<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom announces restructuring.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom announces restructuring.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Portugal Telecom (PT) announced an internal restructuring of Portugal's dominant telecommunications operator to boost the company's focus on its market, a statement said.</p>
<p>Under the new structure, six directorate generals and two central directorates will be created, all of them reporting directly to the board, it said.</p>
<p>&quot;The great innovation consists of the clear orientation of the company to the market and thus to its clients,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The directorate generals cover the following areas: companies, individuals, infrastructure, operational coordination, resources and finance.</p>
<p>The central directorates cover strategic marketing and investigation and development.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
